WEBVTT

00:00:02.830 --> 00:00:08.090
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:01:41.810 --> 00:01:42.550
It hurts!

00:01:42.660 --> 00:01:44.770
Silang, what did you do?

00:01:44.810 --> 00:01:47.200
I just touched the egg.

00:01:47.570 --> 00:01:48.600
Thanks for coming.

00:01:50.350 --> 00:01:52.130
Oh my god.

00:02:08.890 --> 00:02:10.260
It's terrible!

00:02:10.310 --> 00:02:12.310
Why there're so many chickens in this village?

00:02:12.400 --> 00:02:13.400
Exactly.

00:02:16.370 --> 00:02:18.560
Black Chicken of Misfortune

00:02:20.550 --> 00:02:21.710
It's Henhouse Village here,

00:02:22.170 --> 00:02:24.550
the biggest chicken breeding base in China.

00:02:24.740 --> 00:02:26.910
People here all make a living by raising chickens.

00:02:27.680 --> 00:02:29.840
We went to southwestern China

00:02:30.020 --> 00:02:32.190
for novel cuisine.

00:02:32.620 --> 00:02:34.630
We just left Guangzhou,

00:02:34.930 --> 00:02:36.780
and decided to stay in the Henhouse Village overnight.

00:02:38.540 --> 00:02:41.270
Fifteen Rolls of Southwestern Specialty Recipe.

00:02:41.410 --> 00:02:43.710
Why did you spend all your money left

00:02:43.760 --> 00:02:44.800
on it?

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:46.580
He will leave everything behind

00:02:46.810 --> 00:02:49.060
when there's something to do with cuisine.

00:02:49.400 --> 00:02:51.460
He's the First Nerd of Cuisine in China.

00:02:52.050 --> 00:02:53.250
But the recipe

00:02:53.530 --> 00:02:54.600
can't be eaten

00:02:54.650 --> 00:02:56.960
at any rate.

00:02:57.700 --> 00:02:58.480
How could you?

00:02:58.640 --> 00:02:59.530
Can you think more about anything else

00:02:59.580 --> 00:03:00.630
rather than food?

00:03:02.370 --> 00:03:03.390
Well,

00:03:03.420 --> 00:03:05.150
the same to you.

00:03:11.150 --> 00:03:12.170
Belly is the most honest.

00:03:13.450 --> 00:03:15.610
What's that? It seems to be fun!

00:03:16.800 --> 00:03:18.310
I heard that there'll be a tasting of
chicken cuisine tomorrow.

00:03:18.360 --> 00:03:20.080
It's a kind of famous food here.

00:03:20.410 --> 00:03:21.800
All the restaurants in this village will be present.

00:03:21.940 --> 00:03:24.440
It's the annual Chicken Cuisine Competition.

00:03:24.650 --> 00:03:26.200
The winner will get money

00:03:26.250 --> 00:03:27.700
and great honor.

00:03:28.630 --> 00:03:30.160
I'm so curious about

00:03:30.370 --> 00:03:31.400
the cuisine tomorrow.

00:03:32.880 --> 00:03:35.360
Curiosity can't refuel your belly.

00:03:35.470 --> 00:03:36.360
I must tell you...

00:03:36.960 --> 00:03:37.420
It's quite strange.

00:03:38.880 --> 00:03:40.830
Silang, what are you doing?

00:03:41.310 --> 00:03:43.340
Don't take others’ things without permission.

00:03:43.740 --> 00:03:44.600
Don't worry.

00:03:44.760 --> 00:03:46.270
Nobody lives here.

00:03:46.510 --> 00:03:48.120
This house is so dilapidated.

00:03:49.120 --> 00:03:49.930
It hurts.

00:03:54.540 --> 00:03:56.970
Help! Put me down!

00:03:58.670 --> 00:03:59.380
It really hurts!

00:03:59.430 --> 00:04:01.150
I'm sorry that my house is so old.

00:04:04.800 --> 00:04:06.350
Silang, did you see that? Apologize to her now.

00:04:06.450 --> 00:04:07.180
I won't.

00:04:07.410 --> 00:04:09.200
I'm badly hurt.

00:04:09.250 --> 00:04:10.420
You should pay for my doctor bills.

00:04:10.470 --> 00:04:11.680
What are you saying?

00:04:11.730 --> 00:04:12.750
Apologize now!

00:04:12.820 --> 00:04:13.580
I won't.

00:04:13.680 --> 00:04:14.600
Be quick.

00:04:14.650 --> 00:04:15.460
No!

00:04:18.060 --> 00:04:19.210
Take them.

00:04:19.880 --> 00:04:20.960
They're just some astringent persimmons.

00:04:22.200 --> 00:04:23.070
Come in and have a meal.

00:04:23.300 --> 00:04:25.050
Actually it's a restaurant.

00:04:30.990 --> 00:04:31.780
This, this is...

00:04:32.400 --> 00:04:33.790
The graffiti is so scary.

00:04:34.020 --> 00:04:36.020
(Pestilence gods)

00:04:36.020 --> 00:04:38.020
(Bastard)

00:04:38.020 --> 00:04:38.940
(Black Feather Restaurant)

00:04:40.360 --> 00:04:41.680
Don't mind.

00:04:42.340 --> 00:04:43.460
(Black Feather Restaurant)
It happens.

00:04:44.470 --> 00:04:45.840
Well, come in please.

00:04:50.620 --> 00:04:52.540
Spend money on recipes rather than food,

00:04:52.580 --> 00:04:53.720
leaving yourself penniless.

00:04:54.730 --> 00:04:57.040
You're a naive fool.

00:04:58.080 --> 00:04:59.000
Fool?

00:04:59.370 --> 00:05:01.250
Fools won't survive.

00:05:01.510 --> 00:05:03.170
Just like my silly brother.

00:05:03.400 --> 00:05:04.100
Your brother?

00:05:05.410 --> 00:05:07.380
My brother has passed away.

00:05:07.430 --> 00:05:08.980
He opened this restaurant specializing in chicken food.

00:05:09.210 --> 00:05:10.870
You should serve an egg at least.

00:05:10.920 --> 00:05:11.400
Silang,

00:05:12.270 --> 00:05:14.110
why is this restaurant so dilapidated?

00:05:14.930 --> 00:05:17.050
It's all because nobody comes here.

00:05:17.280 --> 00:05:18.340
Why?

00:05:19.000 --> 00:05:20.980
Chicken is the animal I hate most.

00:05:23.620 --> 00:05:24.490
It's too late now.

00:05:24.610 --> 00:05:25.430
Stay here overnight

00:05:25.480 --> 00:05:26.200
if you don't mind.

00:05:26.680 --> 00:05:28.320
You don't have money, do you?

00:05:32.520 --> 00:05:33.370
It's so weird.

00:05:33.580 --> 00:05:35.120
She hates chicken,

00:05:35.240 --> 00:05:36.530
but she still runs this restaurant.

00:05:37.540 --> 00:05:39.710
And the graffiti on the door.

00:05:39.820 --> 00:05:41.460
It's pointless to think about it.

00:05:41.580 --> 00:05:42.640
We'd better go to sleep.

00:05:44.170 --> 00:05:45.100
I'll have a chicken feast

00:05:45.150 --> 00:05:46.740
in dream.

00:05:46.790 --> 00:05:47.610
Listen,

00:05:52.270 --> 00:05:53.950
what

00:05:54.280 --> 00:05:55.060
is that?

00:05:55.500 --> 00:05:56.620
It's a little scary.

00:06:03.460 --> 00:06:04.980
It may come from there.

00:06:35.560 --> 00:06:36.520
What is this?

00:06:41.140 --> 00:06:42.610
Is this also a chicken?

00:06:42.960 --> 00:06:44.660
It's totally black.

00:06:44.890 --> 00:06:46.330
It creeps me out.

00:06:47.810 --> 00:06:49.610
What is this?

00:06:49.900 --> 00:06:50.990
Don't touch it.

00:06:52.220 --> 00:06:53.260
It'll bring misfortune.

00:06:54.980 --> 00:06:56.910
It's the chicken that killed my brother

00:06:56.960 --> 00:06:58.150
and brought misery.

00:06:59.140 --> 00:07:00.360
It killed your brother?

00:07:01.180 --> 00:07:02.120
What's that?

00:07:11.260 --> 00:07:13.350
It has been almost a month

00:07:13.400 --> 00:07:14.790
since my brother passed away.

00:07:16.310 --> 00:07:17.910
I was living with my brother all the time.

00:07:18.440 --> 00:07:19.600
He once learned some cooking

00:07:19.650 --> 00:07:21.450
in a restaurant in Guangzhou.

00:07:21.660 --> 00:07:23.640
We came here several years ago

00:07:24.040 --> 00:07:25.730
and opened this restaurant named Black Feather Restaurant.

00:07:26.740 --> 00:07:27.690
One day

00:07:27.740 --> 00:07:29.050
my brother came back excitedly

00:07:29.210 --> 00:07:31.600
with a black shiny chicken.

00:07:32.700 --> 00:07:33.160
Tiya,

00:07:33.650 --> 00:07:34.650
this chicken

00:07:34.800 --> 00:07:37.300
may change the history of Henhouse Village.

00:07:38.200 --> 00:07:41.370
But that's just the beginning of all misfortunes.

00:07:42.870 --> 00:07:43.770
The black chickens

00:07:43.820 --> 00:07:45.110
are easy to die.

00:07:45.210 --> 00:07:46.890
It only laid a few eggs.

00:07:47.770 --> 00:07:49.050
Once a black chicken died,

00:07:49.100 --> 00:07:50.600
my brother would take the trouble to buy a new one.

00:07:50.850 --> 00:07:52.270
Then he ran around

00:07:52.310 --> 00:07:53.090
to look for better fodder.

00:07:53.640 --> 00:07:55.580
He took on more debt day by day.

00:07:55.900 --> 00:07:58.210
Finally, all the friends
who did their best to help my brother

00:07:58.320 --> 00:07:59.950
fell ill one after another.

00:08:00.070 --> 00:08:01.560
So did

00:08:01.630 --> 00:08:02.790
my brother himself.

00:08:04.470 --> 00:08:05.030
Tiya,

00:08:06.420 --> 00:08:07.240
I know

00:08:07.640 --> 00:08:10.090
you are suffering a lot these days.

00:08:10.620 --> 00:08:12.230
But I have improved

00:08:12.280 --> 00:08:13.160
the quality and quantity of the chicken at last.

00:08:13.840 --> 00:08:16.310
My dream will come true this year.

00:08:16.340 --> 00:08:17.830
I'll surprise them.

00:08:21.020 --> 00:08:22.860
He passed away

00:08:23.370 --> 00:08:24.300
with this unrealistic dream

00:08:24.350 --> 00:08:25.800
which I can never understand.

00:08:27.130 --> 00:08:29.760
What he left are just these black chickens and debts.

00:08:30.730 --> 00:08:32.450
Later, all the villagers said that

00:08:32.500 --> 00:08:34.790
these chickens could only bring misfortune.

00:08:35.060 --> 00:08:36.990
No one dared come to our restaurant.

00:08:37.700 --> 00:08:39.470
Your brother's dream is...

00:08:39.750 --> 00:08:40.780
He wanted to win the Chicken Cuisine Competition this year

00:08:40.830 --> 00:08:42.690
by these chickens.

00:08:43.170 --> 00:08:44.770
These are his last words.

00:08:45.180 --> 00:08:46.950
I can't understand

00:08:47.000 --> 00:08:48.420
why did he persist in raising these useless chickens.

00:08:48.840 --> 00:08:49.810
It's all his fault.

00:08:49.880 --> 00:08:52.810
You fool! Kill those chickens!

00:08:53.370 --> 00:08:55.170
Why do you raise them?

00:08:55.240 --> 00:08:56.770
Get out!

00:08:58.360 --> 00:09:00.450
The villagers are so mean to me.

00:09:03.180 --> 00:09:06.090
My brother is such an idiot.

00:09:06.700 --> 00:09:07.210
Tiya.

00:09:12.500 --> 00:09:13.010
Tiya.

00:09:13.250 --> 00:09:15.320
have you ever made any cuisine out of these chickens?

00:09:15.580 --> 00:09:16.910
Only once.

00:09:17.470 --> 00:09:18.960
But it's black

00:09:19.010 --> 00:09:19.550
from skin to guts.

00:09:19.630 --> 00:09:20.590
It looks terrible.

00:09:20.750 --> 00:09:22.190
So I threw it away.

00:09:24.950 --> 00:09:25.660
Tiya,

00:09:26.010 --> 00:09:27.610
are you willing to allow me

00:09:27.980 --> 00:09:28.490
to take part in the competition for you tomorrow

00:09:28.540 --> 00:09:29.930
if possible?

00:09:31.100 --> 00:09:33.030
Do you want to use these chickens of misfortune?

00:09:33.430 --> 00:09:35.520
They're not chickens of misfortune.

00:09:36.720 --> 00:09:38.690
They're the dream which your brother
struggled for all his life.

00:09:38.790 --> 00:09:40.860
I promise I'll realize it for him.

00:09:43.870 --> 00:09:49.880
(Chicken Cuisine Competition)

00:09:50.350 --> 00:09:52.360
The Chicken Cuisine Competition

00:09:52.450 --> 00:09:53.560
organized by Henhouse Village

00:09:53.600 --> 00:09:54.840
is going to start.

00:09:55.670 --> 00:09:57.100
The winner

00:09:57.150 --> 00:09:57.850
will get 1 million yuan

00:09:57.940 --> 00:10:00.100
and the honor

00:10:00.460 --> 00:10:02.890
to be carved on the Statue of Chicken

00:10:02.940 --> 00:10:03.510
which will be passed on from generation to generation.

00:10:04.380 --> 00:10:05.850
As usual,

00:10:05.900 --> 00:10:08.310
the expert of chicken cuisine, Mr. Dong,

00:10:08.370 --> 00:10:10.780
mayor and deputy mayor

00:10:11.220 --> 00:10:13.610
will be the fair and discreet judges.

00:10:13.950 --> 00:10:15.290
The winner

00:10:15.500 --> 00:10:17.060
must still be

00:10:17.110 --> 00:10:17.760
Golden Rooster Restaurant.

00:10:17.830 --> 00:10:19.860
It's also possible to be

00:10:19.910 --> 00:10:20.980
Phoenix Restaurant.

00:10:21.040 --> 00:10:22.720
So is Suzaku Gate.

00:10:23.730 --> 00:10:25.230
It's Black Feather Restaurant.

00:10:33.090 --> 00:10:35.010
Are these the chickens of misfortune?

00:10:35.070 --> 00:10:37.040
You're still raising them!

00:10:38.290 --> 00:10:39.220
Back off!

00:10:40.380 --> 00:10:42.140
Does Black Feather Restaurant also take part in...

00:10:42.870 --> 00:10:44.130
Well,

00:10:44.500 --> 00:10:45.410
do you want to make cuisine

00:10:45.460 --> 00:10:45.950
out of these chickens of misfortune?

00:10:46.100 --> 00:10:46.490
Yes.

00:10:47.210 --> 00:10:47.920
Go away!

00:10:48.060 --> 00:10:50.360
Who do you want to bring misfortunes to?

00:10:50.520 --> 00:10:50.910
Yeah.

00:10:50.950 --> 00:10:54.180
My son fell from cliff

00:10:54.230 --> 00:10:55.280
just because of

00:10:55.330 --> 00:10:56.030
these chickens.

00:10:56.120 --> 00:10:56.520
Yes.

00:10:56.570 --> 00:10:57.730
My hens don't lay eggs

00:10:57.870 --> 00:11:00.170
when hearing them crowing.

00:11:01.060 --> 00:11:01.890
What?

00:11:02.130 --> 00:11:04.450
These are all your guess.

00:11:04.560 --> 00:11:05.860
Exactly. They're so excessive!

00:11:06.590 --> 00:11:08.160
Go away.

00:11:08.300 --> 00:11:08.960
Mao!

00:11:10.110 --> 00:11:11.610
Tiya, don't worry.

00:11:12.300 --> 00:11:13.170
According to the rules,

00:11:13.260 --> 00:11:15.180
all the chicken restaurants in this village

00:11:15.340 --> 00:11:16.920
are qualified for this competition, right?

00:11:17.180 --> 00:11:19.560
Yes, it's true.

00:11:19.610 --> 00:11:20.540
All right.

00:11:21.120 --> 00:11:22.290
Let them in

00:11:22.340 --> 00:11:24.170
and then get them out of our village

00:11:24.210 --> 00:11:26.090
for humiliating the competition.

00:11:27.190 --> 00:11:27.820
After all,

00:11:27.870 --> 00:11:29.640
they can't make any good cuisine.

00:11:30.260 --> 00:11:32.830
Okay, you're admitted.

00:11:32.910 --> 00:11:33.740
Black Feather Restaurant.

00:11:33.920 --> 00:11:35.220
It can't be.

00:11:38.240 --> 00:11:40.270
You can start now.

00:11:53.420 --> 00:11:55.000
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:11:57.100 --> 00:11:58.840
Silang, clean the chicken guts.

00:11:58.970 --> 00:11:59.520
OK.

00:11:59.850 --> 00:12:01.270
Meili, prepare the rice.

00:12:01.380 --> 00:12:02.160
No problem.

00:12:08.110 --> 00:12:09.980
I didn't expect him to be so skilled.

00:12:10.660 --> 00:12:11.720
Turn the fire on to maximum.

00:12:11.760 --> 00:12:12.220
I got it.

00:12:12.950 --> 00:12:14.050
Give me more oil.

00:12:14.100 --> 00:12:14.540
All right.

00:12:14.950 --> 00:12:15.850
Take shrimps here.

00:12:15.900 --> 00:12:16.260
OK.

00:12:16.480 --> 00:12:17.650
Three big plates.

00:12:20.770 --> 00:12:22.910
Time is up.

00:12:25.380 --> 00:12:26.740
Now let's start reviewing.

00:12:27.090 --> 00:12:29.030
First, Phoenix Restaurant.

00:12:31.230 --> 00:12:33.120
This is an roast chicken with sweet miso.

00:12:33.170 --> 00:12:34.530
I made it in the way of cooking Peking Duck.

00:12:44.440 --> 00:12:46.120
This Peking Soy Chicken

00:12:46.170 --> 00:12:47.530
tastes really good.

00:12:47.930 --> 00:12:49.400
The skin is crispy

00:12:49.450 --> 00:12:51.130
and the texture is also good.

00:12:51.180 --> 00:12:52.050
It's awesome.

00:12:53.900 --> 00:12:56.010
It seems that Phoenix Restaurant should be the winner.

00:12:56.280 --> 00:12:58.190
Next, Sea and Bird Pavilion.

00:13:18.880 --> 00:13:20.750
And the last is Black Feather Restaurant.

00:13:21.260 --> 00:13:21.650
Yes.

00:13:22.170 --> 00:13:23.920
Well, it's the chicken of misfortune.

00:13:24.440 --> 00:13:25.530
Is the black chicken

00:13:25.580 --> 00:13:27.050
in the clay pan?

00:13:27.220 --> 00:13:28.280
The cuisine can't be tasty

00:13:28.330 --> 00:13:29.990
with such a terrible chicken as material.

00:13:30.030 --> 00:13:30.900
We have had the winner.

00:13:37.860 --> 00:13:38.780
This pan is...

00:13:39.970 --> 00:13:41.990
It's the chicken cuisine of Black Feather Restaurant.

00:13:53.810 --> 00:13:54.390
What?

00:13:54.710 --> 00:13:55.490
This is

00:13:56.320 --> 00:13:58.490
rice. Just rice!

00:14:04.190 --> 00:14:06.060
Kid, don't you know

00:14:06.580 --> 00:14:09.250
this is the serious Chicken Cuisine Competition.

00:14:09.490 --> 00:14:11.450
How dare you just use rice?

00:14:11.550 --> 00:14:12.390
What do you mean?

00:14:12.470 --> 00:14:13.200
Don't be nervous.

00:14:13.420 --> 00:14:15.010
It's 100% chicken cuisine.

00:14:15.150 --> 00:14:16.910
There's no need for us to taste it.

00:14:17.010 --> 00:14:18.490
You must leave the village now!

00:14:20.880 --> 00:14:21.820
Just try it.

00:14:21.860 --> 00:14:22.560
You'll understand.

00:14:22.850 --> 00:14:23.620
What?

00:14:23.940 --> 00:14:24.930
Every rice

00:14:24.980 --> 00:14:26.040
that you see

00:14:26.290 --> 00:14:27.320
contains great passion of a cook

00:14:27.370 --> 00:14:29.430
for chicken cuisine.

00:14:30.820 --> 00:14:32.830
Okay, I'll have a try.

00:14:42.150 --> 00:14:44.050
I've checked the pan.

00:14:44.170 --> 00:14:46.160
It's true that there's only rice.

00:14:50.170 --> 00:14:53.320
The luster and flavour...

00:14:59.140 --> 00:15:00.450
It's chicken!

00:15:00.890 --> 00:15:02.440
It's really the chicken.

00:15:02.560 --> 00:15:04.150
And it's the best one.

00:15:15.140 --> 00:15:18.160
The sweetness is so magnificent and dignified,

00:15:18.580 --> 00:15:20.590
as if a wave sweeping through,

00:15:20.700 --> 00:15:22.180
bringing much splendid colour.

00:15:22.230 --> 00:15:23.170
The texture is so rich and charming

00:15:24.730 --> 00:15:25.510
that my blood...

00:15:26.000 --> 00:15:26.750
I feel that my blood

00:15:26.800 --> 00:15:29.520
is boiling.

00:15:40.520 --> 00:15:42.020
(Yummy)

00:15:55.220 --> 00:15:55.940
You see.

00:15:56.170 --> 00:15:57.120
Three of them

00:15:57.170 --> 00:15:58.910
are completely immersed in the flavour of cuisine.

00:16:00.400 --> 00:16:01.510
Yes!

00:16:01.930 --> 00:16:02.920
Kid.

00:16:03.550 --> 00:16:05.310
I have two questions.

00:16:05.350 --> 00:16:05.780
Yes.

00:16:06.110 --> 00:16:07.970
First, it's rice indeed.

00:16:08.050 --> 00:16:08.890
But why does it have the smell of chicken?

00:16:08.940 --> 00:16:10.510
How do you make it?

00:16:11.670 --> 00:16:13.510
Good questions.

00:16:13.570 --> 00:16:14.860
The secret is

00:16:19.240 --> 00:16:20.760
chicken of misfortune.

00:16:23.810 --> 00:16:25.390
Does it have rice inside?

00:16:25.500 --> 00:16:26.140
Yes.

00:16:26.510 --> 00:16:28.580
I boil it with

00:16:28.650 --> 00:16:29.500
wine and seasonings.

00:16:29.610 --> 00:16:31.500
But I only take the rice out for you.

00:16:32.110 --> 00:16:33.330
Why?

00:16:33.840 --> 00:16:35.270
Because I think this is the best way

00:16:35.360 --> 00:16:37.420
to show its daintiness.

00:16:37.620 --> 00:16:38.120
What?

00:16:39.620 --> 00:16:41.170
To show its daintiness completely,

00:16:41.540 --> 00:16:42.300
I boil it.

00:16:42.350 --> 00:16:44.150
Then all its flavours come out

00:16:44.630 --> 00:16:46.100
and the rice

00:16:46.390 --> 00:16:48.550
can absorb all the essence.

00:16:49.630 --> 00:16:50.400
I see.

00:16:50.810 --> 00:16:51.790
So you can make such wonderful chicken cuisine

00:16:51.840 --> 00:16:53.050
with rice.

00:16:54.220 --> 00:16:57.740
Another secret is that

00:16:57.950 --> 00:16:58.950
the chicken

00:16:59.040 --> 00:17:01.690
has the best flavour which I've never tasted before.

00:17:02.040 --> 00:17:04.240
Its unique, sweet and delicate flavour

00:17:04.290 --> 00:17:05.590
is the most advanced.

00:17:06.640 --> 00:17:07.350
Once I take a bite,

00:17:07.400 --> 00:17:07.970
I feel that

00:17:08.070 --> 00:17:10.210
my blood is boiling.

00:17:10.880 --> 00:17:12.260
So can you tell me

00:17:12.350 --> 00:17:13.760
what is this chicken on earth?

00:17:14.070 --> 00:17:14.990
Yes, sir.

00:17:15.390 --> 00:17:16.290
It's

00:17:19.380 --> 00:17:21.910
the sacred bird of legend, silkie.

00:17:22.340 --> 00:17:23.310
Silkie?

00:17:27.130 --> 00:17:28.170
This is

00:17:29.490 --> 00:17:30.070
the real face

00:17:30.120 --> 00:17:31.830
of the mysterious bird of legend,

00:17:31.940 --> 00:17:33.800
silkie.

00:17:34.870 --> 00:17:35.980
Silkie?

00:17:37.770 --> 00:17:39.000
Do you know

00:17:39.050 --> 00:17:40.610
it's silkie at the first sight?

00:17:41.080 --> 00:17:42.980
It looks completely black.

00:17:43.290 --> 00:17:44.270
So are

00:17:44.320 --> 00:17:45.980
its skin and guts.

00:17:46.710 --> 00:17:49.050
It takes a lot

00:17:49.280 --> 00:17:50.690
for the owner

00:17:50.740 --> 00:17:52.160
to breed such perfect silkies.

00:17:54.220 --> 00:17:55.140
The chicken which is accused of chicken of misfortune

00:17:55.190 --> 00:17:57.250
by all villagers

00:17:57.700 --> 00:17:58.700
has beautiful colour

00:17:58.860 --> 00:18:00.440
if you see it carefully.

00:18:03.810 --> 00:18:05.260
It's not the chicken of misfortune,

00:18:05.650 --> 00:18:06.980
but the chicken

00:18:07.030 --> 00:18:08.390
which can bring infinite happiness

00:18:08.680 --> 00:18:10.700
and 100% good luck.

00:18:12.150 --> 00:18:14.290
Kurou sacrificed himself

00:18:14.330 --> 00:18:15.980
to breed such perfect silkies.

00:18:16.250 --> 00:18:17.220
All he wanted is to

00:18:17.490 --> 00:18:19.930
share the goodliness

00:18:20.000 --> 00:18:21.330
with all villagers.

00:18:22.590 --> 00:18:23.320
Brother.

00:18:24.490 --> 00:18:25.510
If Tiya

00:18:25.730 --> 00:18:27.490
had gave them up,

00:18:27.820 --> 00:18:29.570
they would have been dead.

00:18:29.910 --> 00:18:30.600
Yes.

00:18:31.020 --> 00:18:33.470
I suppose that you must suffer a lot.

00:18:33.570 --> 00:18:34.190
Tiya,

00:18:34.450 --> 00:18:36.000
I must offer deep apology to you

00:18:36.240 --> 00:18:37.280
on behalf of all villagers.

00:18:37.470 --> 00:18:38.440
I'm so sorry.

00:18:40.210 --> 00:18:42.420
I think the result is very clear.

00:18:42.740 --> 00:18:44.250
The winner of

00:18:44.300 --> 00:18:45.540
Chicken Cuisine Competition this year

00:18:45.710 --> 00:18:46.860
is Black Feather Restaurant.

00:18:50.410 --> 00:18:52.920
It's great!

00:18:53.640 --> 00:18:54.540
Brother,

00:18:55.380 --> 00:18:56.500
I'll keep pursuing

00:18:56.630 --> 00:18:57.080
your dream

00:18:57.130 --> 00:18:58.540
from today.

00:19:05.710 --> 00:19:06.990
Kurou discovered this chicken

00:19:07.090 --> 00:19:08.650
and Tiya will inherit and prolong his dream.

00:19:09.630 --> 00:19:10.630
While what others

00:19:10.680 --> 00:19:11.580
are most lacking in

00:19:11.630 --> 00:19:14.170
is such little luck.

00:19:15.310 --> 00:19:16.380
You're Mao, aren't you?

00:19:16.640 --> 00:19:17.330
If you were not here

00:19:17.380 --> 00:19:18.840
today,

00:19:19.000 --> 00:19:19.730
these chickens would

00:19:19.780 --> 00:19:20.790
be thrown

00:19:20.840 --> 00:19:22.670
in the darkest corner.

00:19:23.240 --> 00:19:25.060
You have the vision to identify materials,

00:19:25.430 --> 00:19:27.040
the skill to capture goodliness

00:19:27.270 --> 00:19:28.290
and the most important one,

00:19:28.630 --> 00:19:31.780
the spirit of a cook to help Kurou realize his dream.

00:19:32.260 --> 00:19:34.310
Who are you?

00:19:35.540 --> 00:19:37.340
(Super)

00:19:46.690 --> 00:19:48.240
That is...

00:19:48.440 --> 00:19:49.400
I know.

00:19:49.690 --> 00:19:50.610
You are the youngest cook in history

00:19:50.660 --> 00:19:52.170
who passed the hardest

00:19:52.220 --> 00:19:54.090
Super Chef Test perfectly

00:19:54.530 --> 00:19:56.570
in Guangzhou,

00:19:56.930 --> 00:19:58.050
Mao.

00:20:05.210 --> 00:20:07.730
My brother's tomb is ahead.

00:20:08.210 --> 00:20:09.800
I have to tell him the news
that we win the competition.

00:20:10.720 --> 00:20:12.390
Tiya, it's pretty good.

00:20:12.630 --> 00:20:13.840
All villagers

00:20:13.950 --> 00:20:16.510
will help you raise silkies later.

00:20:17.120 --> 00:20:18.310
It's all thanks to you.

00:20:18.450 --> 00:20:20.790
You realize my brother's dream.

00:20:21.090 --> 00:20:22.180
Never mind.

00:20:22.540 --> 00:20:23.200
Well,

00:20:23.630 --> 00:20:25.360
it seems that there's nobody
in the world except them.

00:20:25.920 --> 00:20:26.370
In that sense,

00:20:26.420 --> 00:20:28.390
you lose.

00:20:28.720 --> 00:20:29.520
What are you saying?

00:20:30.640 --> 00:20:31.310
It hurts.

00:20:31.360 --> 00:20:32.010
I hate it.

00:20:34.330 --> 00:20:35.170
That's my brother's friend.

00:20:35.270 --> 00:20:37.890
My brother met him when learning in Guangzhou.

00:20:39.370 --> 00:20:39.840
It's strange.

00:20:40.980 --> 00:20:43.020
What's the purpose of cuisine, Mao?

00:20:45.180 --> 00:20:45.900
It should

00:20:45.950 --> 00:20:46.880
bring people happiness.

00:20:47.460 --> 00:20:48.080
Chef Zhou Yu!

00:20:48.520 --> 00:20:49.210
Exactly.

00:20:50.160 --> 00:20:51.580
The mission of Super Chef

00:20:51.630 --> 00:20:54.220
is to bring more happiness to others.

00:20:55.310 --> 00:20:56.200
Father?

00:20:57.900 --> 00:20:59.210
My friend Kurou

00:20:59.260 --> 00:21:01.230
suffered a lot when pursuing his dream.

00:21:01.630 --> 00:21:04.740
Thank you for opening the heavy door for him.

00:21:06.770 --> 00:21:07.950
It seems that

00:21:08.000 --> 00:21:09.270
you're becoming more and more like a Super Chef,

00:21:09.320 --> 00:21:09.840
Mao.

00:21:10.450 --> 00:21:11.160
Chef Zhou Yu.

00:21:12.000 --> 00:21:14.380
Allow me to give you my kind regards.

00:21:14.520 --> 00:21:15.600
Father,

00:21:16.340 --> 00:21:17.180
I didn't tell you that

00:21:17.600 --> 00:21:19.200
I went out with Mao.

00:21:19.510 --> 00:21:20.200
I'm sorry.

00:21:22.810 --> 00:21:24.800
He's Mao's master.

00:21:25.120 --> 00:21:26.320
It's true that

00:21:26.410 --> 00:21:27.750
he looks strict.

00:21:29.910 --> 00:21:31.990
You want to learn to cook in Yang Spring Restaurant?

00:21:32.340 --> 00:21:33.120
Yes,

00:21:33.470 --> 00:21:34.780
I'm Mao's first student.

00:21:34.820 --> 00:21:35.700
I'm Silang.

00:21:35.910 --> 00:21:37.710
Okay, I'll teach you seriously.

00:21:37.840 --> 00:21:38.260
Follow me.

00:21:39.880 --> 00:21:41.500
That's great, Silang.

00:21:41.590 --> 00:21:43.790
You'll have a difficult time from today.

00:23:15.100 --> 00:23:17.666
Preview of the next episode

00:23:17.666 --> 00:23:19.981
While Master Ruoh and Zhou Yu were away,

00:23:20.023 --> 00:23:22.525
I was to keep the key of the restaurant

00:23:22.650 --> 00:23:24.819
It's a big responsibility, but I'll do my best.

00:23:24.903 --> 00:23:27.405
At that time, a ridiculous man appeared.

00:23:27.905 --> 00:23:29.407
Next episode, Chūka Ichiban!

00:23:29.490 --> 00:23:30.908
The Best Man on the Continent!

00:23:30.992 --> 00:23:32.952
Challenge to Yang Spring Restaurant

00:23:33.037 --> 00:23:34.329
It will definitely be interesting!
